# Everything under atlas/ is shipped to the browser as-is: a columnar binary,
# a newline-delimited id index the client splits on "\n", vendored bundles and
# generated JSON. This repo has core.autocrlf enabled, which would rewrite line
# endings on a Windows checkout and re-commit them. Opt the whole tree out so
# the bytes Netlify serves are exactly the bytes the build produced.
* -text
